.el .ds Aq '
.TH xil-cues 1  "xil-cues " 
.SH NAME
xil\-cues \- Parse a sound cues & music prompts markdown file into an asset manifest, audit the SFX library, and optionally generate new assets or enrich the episode sfx config.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBxil\-cues\fR [\fB\-\-episode\fR] [\fB\-\-tag\fR] [\fB\-\-show\fR] [\fB\-\-cues\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-generate\fR] [\fB\-\-enrich\-sfx\-config\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Parse a sound cues & music prompts markdown file into an asset manifest, audit the SFX library, and optionally generate new assets or enrich the episode sfx config.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-episode\fR \fI<EPISODE>\fR
Episode tag (e.g. S02E03) — derives sfx config path
.TP
\fB\-\-tag\fR \fI<TAG>\fR
Raw tag for non\-episodic content (e.g. V01C03, D01)
.TP
\fB\-\-show\fR \fI<SHOW>\fR
Show name override (default: from project.json)
.TP
\fB\-\-cues\fR \fI<CUES>\fR
Path to cues markdown file (auto\-detected from cues/ if omitted)
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Show audit report and enrichment diff without API calls or sfx config writes (manifest is always written)
.TP
\fB\-\-generate\fR
Generate NEW assets via ElevenLabs API into SFX/
.TP
\fB\-\-enrich\-sfx\-config\fR
Update episode SFX config with cues\-sheet prompts/durations
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
